B.cNs=s(["Send a voice note saying one specific thing you appreciated about them today.","Plan a no-phone hour together \u2014 phones face down, eyes on each other.","Remember a small detail they mentioned and bring it up later; it shows you listen.","Compliment their character, not only their appearance \u2014 depth keeps hearts close.","Schedule a weekly check-in: \u201cHow are we feeling about us?\u201d","Share a playlist of songs that remind you of them \u2014 three tracks is enough.","Apologize quickly when you are wrong; pride is the enemy of closeness.","Celebrate their wins loudly, even the small ones \u2014 promotion, recipe, good day.","Ask \u201cWhat would make this week easier for you?\u201d and follow through once.","Leave a handwritten note in their bag, book, or on the mirror.","Plan surprise comfort: their favorite snack after a hard day.","Touch base mid-day with a kind text \u2014 not demanding, just warm.","Learn one thing they care about and ask a thoughtful question about it.","Defend them kindly in public; loyalty builds trust.","Create a shared inside joke \u2014 intimacy loves private language.","Book something to look forward to: concert, class, weekend trip.","Practice patience when they need space; trust is quiet confidence.","Cook or order their favorite meal without being asked.","Take photos together that are candid, not only posed perfection.","Say thank you for ordinary things: listening, driving, patience.","Introduce them proudly to friends \u2014 belonging matters.","Keep promises small and large; reliability is romance in action.","Flirt after you are comfortable \u2014 playfulness keeps sparks alive.","Ask about their family with genuine curiosity, not interrogation.","Share your feelings with calm words instead of guessing games.","Plan a tech-free walk and hold hands if you both want that.","Respect their boundaries without making them explain twice.","Send a meme or reel that made you think of them \u2014 light connection counts.","Celebrate anniversaries of small moments: first coffee, first laugh.","Offer help before they have to ask \u2014 dishes, errands, ride.","Speak their love language: time, words, gifts, acts, touch \u2014 learn which lands.","Do not weaponize the past in arguments; solve today\u2019s issue today.","Plan a double date with friends who bring good energy.","Write three things you love about them and read one aloud.","Protect their reputation online and offline.","Wake up early once to make breakfast \u2014 effort is attractive.","Listen without fixing unless they ask for advice.","Share goals and ask how you can support, not control.","Laugh at yourselves when plans fail \u2014 resilience is sexy.","Keep dating each other: dress up for no reason sometimes.","Remember important dates in your calendar with alerts.","Give them the last bite if they love it \u2014 generosity in small things.","Plan a cozy movie night with their favorite blanket rules.","Tell them when you are proud of how they handled something hard.","Be consistent with good morning and good night kindness.","Create a shared tradition: Sunday brunch, Friday playlist, monthly adventure.","Forgive fast when intent was good \u2014 hold grace like a gift.","Ask for what you need clearly instead of testing them.","Surprise them with flowers, a plant, or something living and hopeful.","Dream aloud about the future together \u2014 direction feels safe.","Choose them again today \u2014 love is a daily decision, not a one-time event."],t.s)
